H("888.d.21.A",3,"A student checks a bladder tank for cracks and chafing and a metal tank for corrosion and leaks. She is:","inspecting a metal, bladder or integral fuel tank",["painting the tank","ignoring the tank","buying a tank"],"Tank inspection.")
