H("888.d.21.B",4,"A selector valve that feels loose or doesn't stop at each tank should be:","repaired or replaced",["ignored","painted","oiled only"],"Fix loose selector.")
H("888.d.21.C",3,"A technician drains a small sample from the lowest point of the tank into a clear cup and looks for water. She is:","draining a fuel system sump",["filling a tank","painting a tank","washing a tank"],"Sump drain.")
