H("888.d.21.D",3,"A mechanic removes a fuel strainer bowl, cleans the screen and replaces the gasket. She is:","servicing a fuel system strainer",["painting the strainer","ignoring the screen","adding oil"],"Strainer service.")
H("888.d.21.D",4,"Debris found in a fuel strainer screen may indicate:","contamination in the tank or lines",["clean fuel","perfect flow","a new engine"],"Debris clue.")
H("888.d.21.E",3,"A mechanic looks in the manual for the fuel system inspection steps and the servicing and troubleshooting charts. She is:","identifying and locating fuel system operating instructions, inspection procedures and troubleshooting information",["guessing","ignoring the manual","using memory"],"Fuel system data.")
H("888.d.21.E",4,"Fuel system instructions for a specific aircraft are found in:","its maintenance manual",["a magazine","a flyer","a pamphlet"],"AMM source.")
H("888.d.22.A",3,"A student labels the armature, field coils, commutator and brushes of a DC generator. She is:","identifying the components of generators, DC generation systems and DC power distribution",["labeling seats","labeling tires","labeling lights"],"DC gen parts.")
