H("888.d.22.B",3,"A student explains how a spinning armature cuts the field and produces current that flows to the bus. She is:","explaining the basic operation of generators, DC generation systems and DC power distribution",["avoiding generators","describing seats","describing tires"],"DC gen operation.")
H("888.d.22.B",4,"A DC generator's output voltage depends on the speed of the armature and the:","strength of the magnetic field",["tire pressure","seat position","paint color"],"Field strength.")
H("888.d.22.C",3,"A student labels the stator, rotor and rectifier of an alternator. She is:","identifying the components of alternators, AC generation systems and AC power distribution",["labeling seats","labeling tires","labeling lights"],"Alternator parts.")
H("888.d.22.C",4,"Many light aircraft alternators use a diode rectifier to:","change AC output into DC for the bus",["add voltage","cool the engine","store fuel"],"Rectifier.")
H("888.d.22.D",3,"A student explains how a spinning rotor induces current in the stator windings and sends power to the aircraft. She is:","explaining the basic operation of alternators, AC generation systems and AC power distribution",["avoiding alternators","describing seats","describing tires"],"Alternator operation.")
