H("888.d.22.G",3,"A mechanic checks a wire chart for the right gauge for a 20-amp load over a 15-foot run. She is:","explaining aircraft wiring size and type selection criteria",["guessing the gauge","ignoring the load","using any wire"],"Wire sizing.")
